---
import release from '../data/release.json';
import { url } from '../lib/urls';
const canonical=new URL(url('download/'),Astro.site).href;
const ogImage=new URL(url('brand/rexafs-og.jpg'),Astro.site).href;
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>Download rexafs {release.version}</title><meta name="description" content="Download verified stable rexafs desktop packages for macOS, Windows and Linux, or install the Python, TypeScript and Rust libraries."/><link rel="icon" href={url('favicon.svg')}/><link rel="canonical" href={canonical}/><meta property="og:title" content={`Download rexafs ${release.version}`}/><meta property="og:description" content="Free, open-source X-ray absorption analysis for macOS, Windows and Linux, plus Python, TypeScript and Rust packages."/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:url" content={canonical}/><meta property="og:image" content={ogImage}/></head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<header><a class="brand" href={url()}><img src={url('favicon.svg')} width="27" height="27" alt=""/>rexafs</a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href={url('docs/desktop/')}>Desktop</a><a href={url('docs/libraries/')}>Libraries</a><a href={url('docs/getting-started/install/')}>Installation guide</a><a href="https://github.com/Ameyanagi/rexafs">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav></header>
<main id="main"><p class="eyebrow">STABLE {release.version} · VERIFIED {release.verified}</p><h1>Start your next analysis.</h1><p class="intro">rexafs is free and open source. Choose the desktop package for your computer, or bring the same processing engine into your code. No Python, Rust or internet connection is needed to run the desktop.</p>
<div class="downloads">{release.platforms.map(platform=><article><h2>{platform.os}</h2><p class="arch">{platform.arch}</p><p>{platform.note}</p><a class="download" href={platform.url}>Download <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="checksum" href={platform.sha256}>SHA-256 checksum</a></article>)}</div>
<p class="support">macOS packages are signed and notarized DMG installers: open the image and drag rexafs into Applications. Windows and Linux are desktop previews. The Windows installer runs per user without administrator rights; the executable is not publisher-signed in this release. Linux uses the Ubuntu 24.04 runtime baseline and requires a graphical session with a Vulkan driver. See the <a href={url('docs/getting-started/install/')}>platform requirements and checksum verification</a>. ARM64 packages are available for macOS only; Linux ARM64 can be <a href="https://github.com/Ameyanagi/rexafs#build-from-source">built from source</a>.</p>
<section class="included"><h2>What is in the desktop package</h2><ul><li><strong>The complete workflow.</strong> Import, normalization, AUTOBK background removal, Fourier transforms, structures, ReFEFF scattering-path calculations, single and joint fits, series browsing and publication exports. The macOS and Linux packages also bundle FEFF10; Windows uses ReFEFF.</li><li><strong>A worked example.</strong> A measured Cu foil spectrum and a built-in Cu structure, so you can follow <a href={url('docs/getting-started/first-analysis/')}>your first analysis</a> and <a href={url('docs/desktop/fitting/')}>first fit</a> before importing your own data.</li><li><strong>Portable projects.</strong> Save analyses as <code>.rxs</code> files with optional embedded source data, automatic <code>.rxs.bak</code> backups and an exportable analysis folder. See <a href={url('docs/desktop/projects/')}>projects and recovery</a>.</li><li><strong>Offline licenses and updates.</strong> The bundled license reader and the update checker are under <strong>Help</strong>. Updates never install without your action; see <a href={url('docs/getting-started/updates/')}>updates and offline use</a>.</li></ul></section>
<section><h2>Use the libraries</h2><p class="section-lede">The packages expose spectrum processing: normalization, AUTOBK, forward and inverse transforms. The Rust crate additionally includes groups, data treatment, LCF/PCA, structures and fitting. Prebuilt Python wheels and the npm package do not need a Rust compiler.</p><div class="packages"><article><h3>Python</h3><p class="pkg-note">CPython 3.10–3.14 · NumPy results · Jupyter ready</p><pre tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Python project setup commands"><code>{`uv init --python 3.12 rexafs-analysis
cd rexafs-analysis
uv add rexafs==${release.version} numpy
uv run python -c "import rexafs; print(rexafs.__version__)"`}</code></pre><a href={url('docs/libraries/python/')}>Python quick start →</a></article><article><h3>TypeScript / JavaScript</h3><p class="pkg-note">Node 22+ and browsers · WebAssembly · typed declarations</p><pre><code>bun add rexafs@{release.version}</code></pre><a href={url('docs/libraries/typescript/')}>Node and browser guide →</a></article><article><h3>Rust</h3><p class="pkg-note">Full API · optional plotting, ReFEFF, FEFF10 and structure sources</p><pre><code>cargo add rexafs@{release.version}</code></pre><a href={url('docs/libraries/rust/')}>Rust guide →</a></article></div></section>
<p class="links"><a href={release.releaseUrl}>Release notes and all assets ↗</a> · <a href={url('releases/')}>Release history</a> · <a href={url('docs/getting-started/updates/')}>Updates and offline installation</a> · <a href={url('docs/troubleshooting/')}>Troubleshooting</a></p>
</main><footer><span>rexafs · open source under MIT or Apache-2.0</span><nav aria-label="Footer"><a href={url('docs/getting-started/')}>Documentation</a><a href={url('licenses/')}>Licenses and data</a><a href="https://github.com/Ameyanagi/rexafs/issues">Get help ↗</a></nav></footer></body></html>
<style> :global(*){box-sizing:border-box}:global(body){margin:0;background:#f7f7f2;color:#26342c;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}:global(a){color:#365e4b}:global(a:focus-visible){outline:3px solid #00747c;outline-offset:5px}.skip{position:fixed;top:-80px;left:12px;background:white;padding:12px;z-index:100}.skip:focus{top:12px}header,main,footer{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:30px 40px}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #d5dacd}header nav{display:flex;gap:25px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;flex-wrap:wrap}header nav a,footer a,.brand,.download,.checksum,.packages a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}header nav a:hover,footer nav a:hover{color:#92511f}.brand{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-weight:750;font-size:27px;letter-spacing:-1.3px}main{padding-top:65px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:700;color:#5a6762}h1{font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,58px);letter-spacing:-2px;font-weight:550;margin:0 0 20px}.intro{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#657061;margin:0 0 40px;max-width:720px}.downloads{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px}article{min-width:0;border:1px solid #d5dacd;background:white;border-radius:8px;padding:24px}.downloads h2{font-size:25px;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:0}.arch{font-size:15px;margin:6px 0 4px}.downloads article>p:not(.arch){font-size:12px;color:#697463;min-height:36px;margin:0 0 14px}.download{background:#2d493d;color:white;border-radius:4px;padding:12px 15px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;font-weight:650}.download:hover{background:#20382e}.checksum{font-size:11px;display:block;margin-top:15px;color:#365e4b}.support a,.included a,.links a,.section-lede a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px}.support{color:#606d5c;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;margin:25px 0 48px;max-width:860px}section{border-top:1px solid #d5dacd;padding-top:28px;margin-bottom:44px}section h2{font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-.8px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 14px}.included ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px 40px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:#3f4a45}.included li{padding-right:8px}.included code{font-size:12px}.section-lede{font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:#606d5c;max-width:760px;margin:0 0 22px}.packages{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin:0}.packages article{padding:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.packages h3{margin:0 0 4px}.pkg-note{font-size:11px;color:#697463;margin:0 0 12px}.packages pre{font-size:11px;overflow:auto;padding-bottom:7px;margin:0 0 14px;flex:1}.packages a{font-size:12px;font-weight:650;color:#365e4b}.links{font-size:13px;line-height:2;margin:0 0 20px}footer{font-size:12px;border-top:1px solid #d5dacd;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#606d5c}footer nav{display:flex;gap:20px}@media(max-width:850px){.downloads,.packages,.included ul{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:550px){header,main,footer{padding-left:22px;padding-right:22px}header{flex-wrap:wrap}header nav{gap:14px}.downloads,.packages,.included ul{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
